    "verseCount": 5,
    "content": "<p class=\"d\">A Psalm by David.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"1\" data-sid=\"PSA 15:1\" class=\"v\">1</span>Yahweh, who shall dwell in your sanctuary?</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 15:1\" class=\"q2\">Who shall live on your holy hill?</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"2\" data-sid=\"PSA 15:2\" class=\"v\">2</span>He who walks blamelessly and does what is right,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 15:2\" class=\"q2\">and speaks truth in his heart;</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"3\" data-sid=\"PSA 15:3\" class=\"v\">3</span>he who doesn’t slander with his tongue,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 15:3\" class=\"q2\">nor does evil to his friend,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 15:3\" class=\"q2\">nor casts slurs against his fellow man;</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"4\" data-sid=\"PSA 15:4\" class=\"v\">4</span>in whose eyes a vile man is despised,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 15:4\" class=\"q2\">but who honors those who fear Yahweh;</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 15:4\" class=\"q2\">he who keeps an oath even when it hurts, and doesn’t change;</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"5\" data-sid=\"PSA 15:5\" class=\"v\">5</span>he who doesn’t lend out his money for usury,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 15:5\" class=\"q2\">nor take a bribe against the innocent.</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 15:5\" class=\"b\"></p><p data-vid=\"PSA 15:5\" class=\"q1\">He who does these things shall never be shaken.</p>",
